====================================
Basis set linear dependence analysis
====================================

. Linear dependence is detected by small overlap matrix eigenvalues

. Overlap matrix eigenfunctions with eigenvalues less than the
  linear_dependence_tolerance are projected out of the AO basis
  leading to, in this case, some exact-zero MO eigenvalues.

